@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml
title HANBAY - Normal checkout with actual hotel time
|Front desk authorized staff|
start
:Choose CHECKED_IN booking;
|System|
:Lock booking and assigned OCCUPIED room;
if (Before scheduled checkout date?) then (Yes)
  :Require separate early-checkout flow;
  stop
endif
if (Now after scheduled checkout instant,12:00?) then (Yes)
  |Front desk authorized staff|
  :Provide nonblank late-checkout note;
endif
:Enter additional charges/reason and actual cash collection;
|System|
:Recompute final balance; validate note and charges;
if (Final debt zero and no overcollection?) then (Yes)
  :Persist CASH receipt/transaction if money collected;
  :Set CHECKED_OUT and actual UTC checked_out_at;
  :Set room DIRTY and append history;
  :Commit all changes together;
else (No)
  :Rollback; keep booking and room unchanged;
endif
note right
  R, MANAGER or ADMIN can check out.
  No automatic extra night or checkout.
  Housekeeping reads DIRTY rooms directly;
  no generated cleaning task.
end note
stop
@enduml
